{#- DeepSeek-V4 chat template (thinking mode), transcribed from the checkpoint's
    canonical encoder (encoding/encoding_dsv4.py in deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813).
    The HF repo ships no chat_template, so this file is the serving-side source
    of truth. Scope: system/user/assistant/tool roles + OpenAI tools, thinking
    mode with tools present (=> reasoning kept on every assistant turn, per the
    encoder's effective_drop_thinking=False rule). DSML argument rendering: when
    a history tool_call's arguments arrive as an unparseable JSON string, we emit
    the single-parameter fallback exactly as encode_arguments_to_dsml does.  -#}
{{- '<｜begin▁of▁sentence｜>' -}}
{%- set dsml = '｜DSML｜' -%}
{%- set tools_block -%}
{%- if tools -%}
## Tools

You have access to a set of tools to help answer the user's question. You can invoke tools by writing a "<{{ dsml }}tool_calls>" block like the following:

<{{ dsml }}tool_calls>
<{{ dsml }}invoke name="$TOOL_NAME">
<{{ dsml }}parameter name="$PARAMETER_NAME" string="true|false">$PARAMETER_VALUE</{{ dsml }}parameter>
...
</{{ dsml }}invoke>
<{{ dsml }}invoke name="$TOOL_NAME2">
...
</{{ dsml }}invoke>
</{{ dsml }}tool_calls>

String parameters should be specified as is and set `string="true"`. For all other types (numbers, booleans, arrays, objects), pass the value in JSON format and set `string="false"`.

If thinking_mode is enabled (triggered by <think>), you MUST output your complete reasoning inside <think>...</think> BEFORE any tool calls or final response.

Otherwise, output directly after </think> with tool calls or final response.

### Available Tool Schemas

{% for tool in tools %}{{ tool.function | tojson }}
{% endfor %}
You MUST strictly follow the above defined tool name and parameter schemas to invoke tool calls.
{%- endif -%}
{%- endset -%}
{%- set ns = namespace(sys_done=false, in_tool_turn=false) -%}
{%- for message in messages -%}
    {%- set next_role = messages[loop.index].role if not loop.last else 'END' -%}
    {%- if message.role == 'tool' -%}
        {%- if not ns.in_tool_turn -%}
            {{- '<｜User｜>' -}}
            {%- set ns.in_tool_turn = true -%}
        {%- else -%}
            {{- '\n\n' -}}
        {%- endif -%}
        {{- '<tool_result>' + (message.content if message.content is string else message.content | tojson) + '</tool_result>' -}}
        {%- if next_role == 'assistant' or next_role == 'END' -%}
            {{- '<｜Assistant｜><think>' -}}
            {%- set ns.in_tool_turn = false -%}
        {%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
        {%- set ns.in_tool_turn = false -%}
        {%- if message.role == 'system' -%}
            {{- message.content if message.content else '' -}}
            {%- if tools -%}{{- '\n\n' + tools_block -}}{%- endif -%}
            {%- set ns.sys_done = true -%}
        {%- elif message.role == 'user' -%}
            {%- if not ns.sys_done and tools and loop.first -%}
                {{- tools_block + '\n\n' -}}{%- set ns.sys_done = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {{- '<｜User｜>' + (message.content if message.content is string else message.content | tojson) -}}
            {%- if next_role == 'assistant' or next_role == 'END' -%}
                {{- '<｜Assistant｜><think>' -}}
            {%- endif -%}
        {%- elif message.role == 'assistant' -%}
            {{- (message.reasoning_content if message.reasoning_content else '') + '</think>' -}}
            {{- message.content if message.content else '' -}}
            {%- if message.tool_calls -%}
                {{- '\n\n<' + dsml + 'tool_calls>\n' -}}
                {%- for tc in message.tool_calls -%}
                    {{- '<' + dsml + 'invoke name="' + tc.function.name + '">\n' -}}
                    {%- if tc.function.arguments is mapping -%}
                        {%- for k, v in tc.function.arguments | items -%}
                            {%- if v is string -%}
                                {{- '<' + dsml + 'parameter name="' + k + '" string="true">' + v + '</' + dsml + 'parameter>\n' -}}
                            {%- else -%}
                                {{- '<' + dsml + 'parameter name="' + k + '" string="false">' + (v | tojson) + '</' + dsml + 'parameter>\n' -}}
                            {%- endif -%}
                        {%- endfor -%}
                    {%- else -%}
                        {{- '<' + dsml + 'parameter name="arguments" string="false">' + tc.function.arguments + '</' + dsml + 'parameter>\n' -}}
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {{- '</' + dsml + 'invoke>\n' -}}
                {%- endfor -%}
                {{- '</' + dsml + 'tool_calls>' -}}
            {%- endif -%}
            {{- '<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>' -}}
        {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if add_generation_prompt and messages and messages[-1].role not in ['user', 'tool'] -%}
    {{- '<｜Assistant｜><think>' -}}
{%- endif -%}
